{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/intnews/20261128/photo/bkn-20261128224012893-1128_00992_001_01p.jpg?20261128231204\"/><p>堪察加半島發生地震。</p><p>中國地震台網測定，俄羅斯堪察加半島於香港時間周六（28日）晚上9時15分發生黎克特制6.8級地震，震源深度為200公里。目前暫無人員傷亡及財產損失報告，正展開相關監測與評估工作。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-28T15:20:18.801660+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":108,"images":1,"source":"東網 國際","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-28T14:40:12+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-28T15:13:53.655163+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-28T15:13:53.655163+00:00","content_hash":"df1da983faabf7556c5004f581ea18893b42ca1c899416ef90afc686e0e61e9d","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}